# Example task. Try:
#   rosetta validate examples/split-parser.rosetta
#   rosetta encode examples/split-parser.rosetta --to concise
#   rosetta encode examples/split-parser.rosetta --to dsl
R1 split-parser-module
OBJ "Split the DSL parser module into a lexer and a grammar file."
SCOPE "crates/rosetta-encode"
MUST_NOT "Change the public API of rosetta-encode."
SHOULD "Keep each file under 400 lines."
DO "Move the tokenizer into lexer.rs."
CTX file:crates/rosetta-encode/src/dsl.rs
ACCEPT "cargo test --workspace passes without changes to test files."
EVIDENCE "Test output for rosetta-encode."
PERM modify_files=permitted commit_changes=forbidden run_commands=permitted network=forbidden
BUDGET tokens=20000
SRC "Please split the DSL parser into a lexer and a grammar file without changing the public API."
